          "text": "⟪ወአዘዘ ፡ ይቅትልዎሙ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ግደሉ ፡ ብሎ ፡ አዘዘ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": "፳",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፳ ፤ ⟪ወእምዝ ፡ ወረደ ፡ እምይሁዳ ፡ ለቂሣርያ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከዚህ ፡ በኋላ ፡ ከይሁዳ ፡ ወደ ፡ ቂሣርያ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሂደ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪እስመ ፡ ተምዐ ፡ ላዕለ ፡ ሰብአ ፡ ጢሮስ ፡ ወሲዶና ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በጢሮስ ፡ በሲዶና ፡ ሰዎች ፡ ተቆጥቶ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነበርና ፡ ከቁጣ ፡ ላይ ፡ ቁጣ ፡ አያይዞ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 3,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወመጽኡ ፡ ኅቡረ ፡ ኀቤሁ ፡ ወአስተብቍዕዎ ፡ ለብ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ላስጦን ፡ መጋቤ ፡ ንጉሥ ፡ ከመ ፡ ይዕርቆሙ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አንድ ፡ ሁነው ፡ መጥተው ፡ የንጉሡ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ባለሟል ፡ ብላስጦንን ፡ አስታርቀን ፡ ብ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለው ፡ ማለዱት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪እስመ ፡ ትእዛዘ ፡ ብሔሮሙ ፡ ኮነ ፡ እምሄሮድስ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ንጉሥ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከሄሮድስ ፡ ተሹሞ ፡ ያገራቸው ፡ ምዝክር፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነበርና ። አንድም ፡ ያገራቸው ፡ ግብር ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በሱ ፡ እጅ ፡ ወጥቶ ፡ ከሄሮድስ ፡ ዘንድ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ደርሶ ፡ ወደ ፡ ቄሣር ፡ ያልፍ ፡ ነበርና ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አንድም ፡ እስመ ፡ ውእቱ ፡ ይሴሲ ፡ ማ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዕደ ፡ ንጉሥ ፡ የንጉሥ ፡ ግብር ፡ አግቢ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነበርና ። አንድም ፡ እስመ ፡ እሙንቱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይሴስዩ ፡ ማዕደ ፡ ንጉሥ ፡ የንጉሥ ፡ ግብ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ር ፡ አግቦች ፡ ነበሩና ፡ ግብር፡ አስቀርተው፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንደ ፡ ጭልጋ ፡ እስመ ፡ እሙንቱ ፡ ይሴ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስዩ ፡ እማዕደ ፡ ንጉሥ ፡ የንጉሥ ፡ ግብረ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በሎች ፡ ነበሩ ፡ ገበታ ፡ ረግጠው ፡ ነበ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ርና ። አንድም ፡ እስመ ፡ ደቀ ፡ ጽርሑ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይላል ። ባለሟሉ ፡ ነበርና ፡ አስታርቀን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብለው ፡ ማለዱት ፡ ፩ ፡ ነገሥ ፡ ፭ ፥ ፱ ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲፩ ። ሕዝ ፡ ፳፯ ፥ ፲፯ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": "፳፩",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፳፩ ፤ ⟪ወእምዝ ፡ አሐተ ፡ ዕለተ ፡ ለብሰ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሄሮድስ ፡ ልብሰ ፡ መንግሥቱ ፡ ወነበረ ፡ ዐውደ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከዕለታት ፡ ባንድ ፡ ዕለት ፡ ሄሮድስ ፡ አር",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ድ ፡ አንቀጥቅጥ ፡ የሚባል ፡ ልብሰ ፡ መን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ግሥቱን፡ለብሶ፡በአደባባይ፡በነገር፡ተገኘ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወአኀዘ ፡ ይኰንኖሙ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቅጣት ፡ ጀመረ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 4,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": "፳፪",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፳፪ ፤ ⟪ወዐውየዉ ፡ ሕዝብ ፡ በቃለ ፡ እግዚአብሔር ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወአኮ ፡ በቃለ ፡ ሰብእ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሕዝቡም ፡ ጃንሆይ ፡ ጃንሆይ ፡ ብለው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያይደለ ፡ አምላክ ፡ አምላክ ፡ ብለው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጮሁ ፡ ሕዝ ፡ ፳፰ ፥ ፪ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": "፳፫",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፳፫ ፤ ⟪ወቀሠፎ ፡ መልአከ ፡ እግዚአብሔር ፡ ሶቤሃ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያን ፡ ጊዜ ፡ ከእግዚአብሔር ፡ የታዘዘ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መልአክ ፡ ቀሠፈው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪እስመ ፡ ኢያአኰቶ ፡ ለእግዚአብሔር ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አምላክ ፡ አምላክ ፡ ቢሉት ፡ አይደለሁም፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አላለምና ። አንድም ፡ ስለ ፡ ሰው ፡ ብለህ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያይደለ ፡ ስለ ፡ አምላክ ፡ ተወን ፡ ብለው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለመኑት ፡ ከእግዚአብሔር ፡ የታዘዘ ፡ መላ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ክ ፡ ቀሠፈው ፡ ስለ ፡ አምላክ ፡ ተወን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቢሉት ፡ አልተዋቸውምና ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወዐጺዮ ፡ ሞተ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዐጺዮ ፡ ተልቶ ፡ ጸይዖ ፡ ሸቶ ፡ አንጺዎ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኳ ፡ ደርቋ ፡ ብሎ ፡ አጺዎ ፡ ደጅ ፡ ዘግቶ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የገዛ ፡ አካሉን ፡ እየነጨ ፡ ሞተ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": "፳፬",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፳፬ ፤ ⟪ወቃለ ፡ እግዚአብሔር ፡ ዐብየ ፡ ወበዝኀ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንዲህ ፡ ባለ ፡ ነገር ፡ ወንጌል ፡ ከሁሉ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ደረሰ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": "፳፭",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፳፭ ፤ ⟪ወገብኡ ፡ በርናባስ ፡ ወሳውል ፡ እምኢየሩ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሳሌም ፡ ፈጺሞሙ ፡ መልእክቶሙ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በርናባስና ፡ ሳውልም ፡ አስተዋጽኦውን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አድርሰው ፡ ከኢየሩሳሌም ፡ ተመለሱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
